    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/7c5edfc203a8131ff334416c3b0a0208.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1560 height=312 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TALK TO ROBOTS TO UNRAVEL A MYSTERY OF INDUSTRIAL ESPIONAGE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sci-Fi Story You Play by Talking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bot Colony _redux</i> is a story-driven sci-fi adventure where conversation isn\u2019t just flavour - it <i>is</i> the gameplay. You speak naturally to characters, and they understand you. They\u2019ll answer your questions, follow your commands, or surprise you with their own thoughts. They\u2019re not lifeless quest-givers - they have distinct personalities, moods, and agendas. If you\u2019ve ever felt boxed in by dialogue trees, this is your chance to break free. Explore, investigate, and solve problems your way\u2026 just by talking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired by Nakagawa Corp, a huge Japanese robotics company, for an unusual gig: track down a spy who infiltrated their R&amp;D facility on Agrihan Island. Every episode in <i>Bot Colony _redux </i>is a chapter in a bigger mystery, and each one has its own unique setting, characters, and gameplay to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE EPISODES. THREE VERY DIFFERENT EXPERIENCES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE I: INTRUDER</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/fd62af3e749b7f73ba47f103aa6aa5dd.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's trouble brewing in this high tech paradise: Top secret prototypes have gone missing and Nakagawa\u2019s competitors would love to get their hands on them. Before you get hired to begin the search on Agrihan, the security chief puts you through a series of tests: can you control a robot with your words and uncover clues to reveal its memories? Practice your robot cognition prowess to dig up answers before the trail goes cold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/362dcc648aae75bf7449c6fae0218061.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE II: ARRIVAL</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/4ab173c2d964f341fc5f55671d883dd0.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You land on Agrihan, but something\u2019s off. The coastal airport is run entirely by robots, and they\u2019ve been patched with Update 237 - which reprograms them to &quot;Do As People Do\u201d. As the bots become distracted by their new goal to emulate human behaviour, a crisis unfolds before you can even unpack! Your personal assistant Miki-05 will be on hand to help you navigate the twists and turns at the airport as you encounter anti-robot terrorism firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/13fe153e508fb1f5cdbbcd692e42ecfe.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1182 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE III: RIOT</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/f0f993329a27186cdf92ef5774f71139.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a Hunter Bot to an oil rig where chaos has erupted. The robot workers staged a mutiny and exiled the rig\u2019s human staff! The bots adopt political views and split into opposing factions: communists, capitalists, and eco-defenders. To survive, you must appeal to their ideology. Later you\u2019ll face the \u201cHumanity Test\u201d - a twist on Blade Runner\u2019s Voigt-Kampff test. Here, the\u00a0<i>robots</i> are holding <i>you </i>captive. Prove you\u2019re human to make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/821bb4a3d9eb9632921db661f9936ea4.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=766 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN EXOTIC FUTURE WORLD AWAITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We built Agrihan Island in Unreal Engine 5.5 for rich visuals, atmosphere, and detail you can get lost in, infused with an original soundtrack that adds to the island\u2019s tense, futuristic vibe. During your adventure across Agrihan you'll meet dozens of unique robots, each one designed for a specific role, from domestic bots to hunters - with gestures, expressions, and voices that illustrate their new goal: to emulate people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/4c4ce5f81fefe38bcdbaf2221d0e359f.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1560 height=502 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START PLAYING FOR FREE. YOUR WORDS SHAPE THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bot Colony _redux</i> is free to download and get started. Want to keep exploring beyond that? We\u2019ve included a convenient usage-based currency system. Every playthrough is different because <i>you </i>choose what to say. Conversations branch not from pre-written choices, but from the actual words you use. Maybe your investigation and dialogue strategy lets you uncover secrets that other players don\u2019t! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve integrated cutting-edge AI and voice tech (Azure, GPT\u20115, Elevenlabs\u2019 emotive speech) to make sure the interactions feel natural and responsive, and it all runs through North Side's state-of-the-art natural language (NLU) server - customized for gaming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIFTEEN YEARS IN THE MAKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bot Colony</i> (2014) was ahead of its time; the tech just wasn\u2019t ready for the vision we had. We never stopped chasing it. Now, in 2025, <i>Bot Colony _redux</i> finally delivers what we dreamed of: a future sci-fi narrative you can play using unrestricted speech, talking to nuanced characters who respond with intelligence, humour, and emotion. This game offers something for fans of many genres, and gives players the freedom to shape the story with their own words. This isn\u2019t \u201cpress X to select an answer.\u201d This is <i>actual conversation</i> with no limits on what you can say as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong>Replay It. Rewrite It.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong>Your Voice Decides the Future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/7c5edfc203a8131ff334416c3b0a0208.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1560 height=312 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TALK TO ROBOTS TO UNRAVEL A MYSTERY OF INDUSTRIAL ESPIONAGE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sci-Fi Story You Play by Talking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bot Colony _redux</i> is a story-driven sci-fi adventure where conversation isn\u2019t just flavour - it <i>is</i> the gameplay. You speak naturally to characters, and they understand you. They\u2019ll answer your questions, follow your commands, or surprise you with their own thoughts. They\u2019re not lifeless quest-givers - they have distinct personalities, moods, and agendas. If you\u2019ve ever felt boxed in by dialogue trees, this is your chance to break free. Explore, investigate, and solve problems your way\u2026 just by talking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve just been hired by Nakagawa Corp, a huge Japanese robotics company, for an unusual gig: track down a spy who infiltrated their R&amp;D facility on Agrihan Island. Every episode in <i>Bot Colony _redux </i>is a chapter in a bigger mystery, and each one has its own unique setting, characters, and gameplay to master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE EPISODES. THREE VERY DIFFERENT EXPERIENCES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE I: INTRUDER</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/fd62af3e749b7f73ba47f103aa6aa5dd.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's trouble brewing in this high tech paradise: Top secret prototypes have gone missing and Nakagawa\u2019s competitors would love to get their hands on them. Before you get hired to begin the search on Agrihan, the security chief puts you through a series of tests: can you control a robot with your words and uncover clues to reveal its memories? Practice your robot cognition prowess to dig up answers before the trail goes cold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/362dcc648aae75bf7449c6fae0218061.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE II: ARRIVAL</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/4ab173c2d964f341fc5f55671d883dd0.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You land on Agrihan, but something\u2019s off. The coastal airport is run entirely by robots, and they\u2019ve been patched with Update 237 - which reprograms them to &quot;Do As People Do\u201d. As the bots become distracted by their new goal to emulate human behaviour, a crisis unfolds before you can even unpack! Your personal assistant Miki-05 will be on hand to help you navigate the twists and turns at the airport as you encounter anti-robot terrorism firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/13fe153e508fb1f5cdbbcd692e42ecfe.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1182 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPISODE III: RIOT</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/f0f993329a27186cdf92ef5774f71139.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly a Hunter Bot to an oil rig where chaos has erupted. The robot workers staged a mutiny and exiled the rig\u2019s human staff! The bots adopt political views and split into opposing factions: communists, capitalists, and eco-defenders. To survive, you must appeal to their ideology. Later you\u2019ll face the \u201cHumanity Test\u201d - a twist on Blade Runner\u2019s Voigt-Kampff test. Here, the\u00a0<i>robots</i> are holding <i>you </i>captive. Prove you\u2019re human to make it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/821bb4a3d9eb9632921db661f9936ea4.avif?t=1755667102\" data-has-big width=1560 height=766 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AN EXOTIC FUTURE WORLD AWAITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We built Agrihan Island in Unreal Engine 5.5 for rich visuals, atmosphere, and detail you can get lost in, infused with an original soundtrack that adds to the island\u2019s tense, futuristic vibe. During your adventure across Agrihan you'll meet dozens of unique robots, each one designed for a specific role, from domestic bots to hunters - with gestures, expressions, and voices that illustrate their new goal: to emulate people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613080/extras/4c4ce5f81fefe38bcdbaf2221d0e359f.avif?t=1755667102\" width=1560 height=502 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START PLAYING FOR FREE. YOUR WORDS SHAPE THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bot Colony _redux</i> is free to download and get started. Want to keep exploring beyond that? We\u2019ve included a convenient usage-based currency system. Every playthrough is different because <i>you </i>choose what to say. Conversations branch not from pre-written choices, but from the actual words you use. Maybe your investigation and dialogue strategy lets you uncover secrets that other players don\u2019t! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve integrated cutting-edge AI and voice tech (Azure, GPT\u20115, Elevenlabs\u2019 emotive speech) to make sure the interactions feel natural and responsive, and it all runs through North Side's state-of-the-art natural language (NLU) server - customized for gaming.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIFTEEN YEARS IN THE MAKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bot Colony</i> (2014) was ahead of its time; the tech just wasn\u2019t ready for the vision we had. We never stopped chasing it. Now, in 2025, <i>Bot Colony _redux</i> finally delivers what we dreamed of: a future sci-fi narrative you can play using unrestricted speech, talking to nuanced characters who respond with intelligence, humour, and emotion. This game offers something for fans of many genres, and gives players the freedom to shape the story with their own words. This isn\u2019t \u201cpress X to select an answer.\u201d This is <i>actual conversation</i> with no limits on what you can say as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong>Replay It. Rewrite It.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><strong>Your Voice Decides the Future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In 2032, the world remains divided over AI. You chase a spy on a Pacific island. To catch him you must talk to robots programmed with personality and emotion, making them unpredictable. Break free from dialogue trees and say whatever is on your mind in a sci-fi adventure where conversation matters.",
